  "html": "\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"row cols-3\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"550\" height=\"454\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/Health_for_All_V1-removebg-preview-1.png\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/past-clinics/\">Past Clinics</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Our Mission</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At OllieTree, our mission is to break down barriers to health and wellness by making essential medical care and knowledge accessible to everyone, regardless of their circumstances. We are committed to creating equitable access to healthcare through free community clinics, empowering individuals with the information and resources needed to lead healthier lives.</p><p>We strive to advocate for healthy lifestyles, provide compassionate care to underserved populations, and ensure no one is left behind—particularly vulnerable groups such as the elderly and those facing financial or systemic challenges. By prioritizing accessibility and inclusivity, we aim to bridge gaps in healthcare delivery and empower communities to thrive.</p><p>Together, we envision a world where quality healthcare is not a privilege but a fundamental right, fostering stronger, healthier, and more informed communities.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"911\" height=\"607\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/04/IMG_9119.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"672\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/05/fullsizeoutput_318a-2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"275\" src=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/12/unnamed-e1737301387950-1024x275.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/12/unnamed-e1737301387950-1024x275.jpg 1024w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/12/unnamed-e1737301387950-300x80.jpg 300w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/12/unnamed-e1737301387950-768x206.jpg 768w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/12/unnamed-e1737301387950-1536x412.jpg 1536w, /ollie-tree-redesign/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/12/unnamed-e1737301387950.jpg 1707w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></section>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row cols-9\"><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>PO Box 2422,&nbsp;</b><b>Matthews, NC 28106</b></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>+1 704-839-9583</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div><div class=\"col\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>ollietreefoundation@gmail.com</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Copyright © 2024 OllieTree Foundation</strong></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n"
